# Set The Trend - Quick Start
# ===========================================
# 
# 1. Copy secrets/.env.example to secrets/.env
#    cp secrets/.env.example secrets/.env
#
# 2. Edit secrets/.env with your credentials
#    nano secrets/.env
#
# 3. Run with Docker Compose
#    docker-compose up -d
#
# See secrets/.env.example for all configuration options
